WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Here is my ClassQuest platform in action.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
First, I log in and select a coding challenge.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Then, I write the solution and click submit.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The backend checks the code and tracks my progress.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Thanks for watching the demo!